## 🔐 1. Authentication Module (`/api/auth`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Payload Type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **POST** | `/register` | Citizen naya account banayega | `application/json` |
| **POST** | `/login` | Universal Login (Sabhi roles ke liye) | `application/json` |
| **POST** | `/logout` | Session destroy aur logout karega | None |
| **GET** | `/me` | Current logged-in user ki details dega (Protected) | None |

**Payload: `POST /register**`

```json
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "state": "Madhya Pradesh",
  "city": "Bhopal",
  "pincode": "462001",
  "password": "Password123"
}

```

**Payload: `POST /login**`

```json
{
  "role": "Citizen", // Or "Supervisor", "DeptHead", "SuperAdmin"
  "username": "john@example.com", // Email or Mobile
  "password": "Password123"
}

```

