## 👑 2. Super Admin Module (`/api/superadmin`)

*Requires Role:* `SuperAdmin`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Payload Type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **GET** | `/departments` | Saare onboarded Dept Heads ki list dega | None |
| **POST** | `/departments` | Naya Dept Head create karega | `application/json` |
| **DELETE** | `/departments/:id` | Dept Head account delete karega | Param: `id` |

**Payload: `POST /departments**`

```json
{
  "state": "Madhya Pradesh",
  "city": "Bhopal",
  "pincode": "462001",
  "deptName": "PWD",
  "headName": "Ramesh Kumar",
  "mobile": "9988776655",
  "email": "pwd@bhopal.gov",
  "password": "CustomPassword123"
}

```

