## 🏢 3. Department Head Module (`/api/depthead`)

*Requires Role:* `DeptHead`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Payload Type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **GET** | `/supervisors` | Apne city/dept ke saare supervisors layega | None |
| **POST** | `/supervisors` | Naya Supervisor banayega | `application/json` |
| **GET** | `/complaints` | AI se route hui saari complaints layega | None |
| **PATCH** | `/complaints/assign` | Complaint ko supervisor ko assign karega | `application/json` |
| **PATCH** | `/complaints/approve` | Supervisor ke resolution ko Verify/Reject karega | `application/json` |

**Payload: `POST /supervisors**` *(Note: State/City backend session se khud nikal lega)*

```json
{
  "name": "Raju Mechanic",
  "mobile": "9999988888",
  "email": "raju@pwd.gov",
  "password": "TempPassword123"
}

```

**Payload: `PATCH /complaints/assign**`

```json
{
  "complaintId": "65ab...cdef",
  "supervisorId": "65ab...1234"
}

```

**Payload: `PATCH /complaints/approve**`

```json
{
  "complaintId": "65ab...cdef",
  "action": "Approve" // Ya fir "Reject"
}

```

