## 👷‍♂️ 4. Supervisor Module (`/api/supervisor`)

*Requires Role:* `Supervisor`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Payload Type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **GET** | `/complaints` | Sirf us supervisor ko assign hui complaints layega | None |
| **POST** | `/complaints/resolve` | Resolution proof submit karega (Photo + Note) | `multipart/form-data` |

**Payload: `POST /complaints/resolve**`
*(Backend Multer use kar raha hai, isliye isko FormData me bhejna hai, JSON me nahi)*

* `complaintId`: "65ab...cdef" (Text)
* `description`: "Pothole filled with concrete" (Text)
* `proofImage`: [File Object] (Image File)

---

## 🙋‍♂️ 5. Citizen Module (`/api/citizen`)

*Requires Role:* `Citizen`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Payload Type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **GET** | `/complaints` | Citizen ki khud ki lodge ki hui saari complaints dega | None |
| **POST** | `/complaints` | Nayi complaint AI Engine ko bhejega | `multipart/form-data` |

**Payload: `POST /complaints**`
*(Again, FormData use karna hai kyunki optional file upload hai)*

* `title`: "Huge Pothole on main road" (Text)
* `description`: "Detailed problem description..." (Text)
* `document`: [File Object] (Image/PDF - Optional)

