## 🖼️ 6. Static File Access (Images)

Jab bhi frontend me supervisor dwara upload ki gayi image dikhani ho, toh backend ke `/uploads` route ka use karna.

* **URL Pattern:** `http://localhost:5000/uploads/filename.jpg`